Gdy zdobędziemy zaufanie mieszkańców wyspy i odpowiedną ilość punktów po ukończeniu questa za wykonywane na wyspie zadania, punkty możemy wymienić na przedmioty. Wystarczy zapytać o "trust points". 


 Przedmiot","location_description":"Centrum Rascacoon.","npc_lines":["Hail, visitor! Welcome! You can ask me about your 'trust points'!","I am the shaman of Rascacoon.","I'm the diviner of the will of the great raccoon and keeper of wisdom.","This colony lived in peace for centuries, but this peace is now severely disrupted. The pirats became a constant threat and annoyance.","This colony is called Rascacoon. But our tribe originates from a far way rascoohan city with the name Washingstone.","When they were still known as Corym, there were only occasional clashes over loot and flotsam. But one day things changed.","It's only a place of mystery and legend. We have no contact since generations and its location was lost in time.","Our spies found out that the Corym retrieved an ancient book from a trunk in a shipwreck. It taught them about the ways of the pirates.","Their leaders were convinced that this was a description of the old and forgotten ways of their people and they adopted it.","They became the pirats that we know today. They became more organized and more aggressive.","Things escalated when they by chance discovered the explosiveness of the mold of one of their favourite cheeses.","They weaponized the mold and refined it to so called green powder to create devastating weapons.","For now they employ it to terrorize the seas and experiment with its power.","It's only a matter of time until they will come and use their weapons against us. Therefore they have to be stopped.","I fear they have yet to unleash the true destructive power of this weapon. For all what we know they keep experimenting and refining it, somewhere deep in their dens. ...","To disrupt those experiments might prove helpful.","We know many secrets and studied the pirats for a long time. Our knowledge will prove helpful in fighting them.","Before we share our knowledge you have to help us, to strengthen our position and secure our colony.","When we feel safe enough from their retribution, we can approve a strike to the heart of the pirats. Until then it will be your mission to assist our colony.","He is our creator and guide.","The mother of all gave birth to the gods. The gods immediately begun with the creation of the world, as this was their only purpose.","Their greatest accomplishment was the creation of the great raccoon. Of all of the gods creations only he was perfect and therefore he was unique.","But the great raccoon immediately felt an enormous loneliness, because all of creation had their peers to bond but the unique raccoon hadn't.","So after the gods were done with creation, the great raccoon stole the secret of life out of their trashcan and created us Rascoohans in his image.","The great raccoon looks over us and we live our life to his enjoyment.","When the gods moved on to create other world, the great raccoon stood behind and kept watching over us.","What king? We have no king or leader. We have to convince other to cooperate and don't order them.","Are you sure that you want to listen to rascoohan wisdom? It might shatter the perception of reality for the weak.","Fools rush in while the iron is still hot.","It's better to be poor and healthy than to throw stones from inside a glasshouse.","If a man fools you once, shame on him. But if you teach him how to fish, he'll probably won't bother you ever again.","Never pass on a free snack or an unsecured trashcan - which is basically the same.","Too many cooks are better than one.","The early bird gets the worm. But the worm got up even more early and what good did it do him?"],"npc_lines_semantics":"source_utterances_without_trigger_or_state_assignment","profession":"szaman","quest_references":[{"label":"A Pirate's Tail Quest","url":"https://tibiopedia.pl/quests/A_Pirates_Tail_Quest"}],"specialty":null,"tp_coordinate_frame":"tibiopedia-map-pixels-floor-unverified","tp_map_markers":[[3905,2415,8]],"tp_trade_available":"nie","tp_trade_reference":{"BuyFromPlayer":{},"SellToPlayer":{}},"voices_text":null}}
